BT 1 0 0 1 0 49.5 Tm /F1 8 Tf 11.5 TL (Coronary artery disease \(CAD\) kills millions of people worldwide every year, largely because severe arterial blockages develop silently until an) Tj T* (acute heart attack occurs. In outpatient screening, non-invasive risk models can help identify high-risk patients early enough to begin preventative) Tj T* (medical care. However, deploying machine learning in healthcare requires much more than training a model in a notebook: the pipeline must) Tj T* (guarantee zero data leakage, prioritize clinical Recall to minimize fatal false negatives, run with sub-10ms latency, enforce non-root container) Tj T* (security, and monitor for demographic concept drift in real time.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 46 261 cm
q
BT 1 0 0 1 0 95.5 Tm 11.5 TL /F1 8 Tf .176471 .215686 .282353 rg (For Assignment 01 of BITS Pilani AIMLCZG523 \(MLOps\), I engineered an end-to-end, production-ready MLOps platform around the benchmark) Tj T* /F2 8 Tf (Heart Disease UCI Cleveland dataset) Tj /F1 8 Tf ( \(303 patient records, 14 clinical biomarkers\). Covering all 9 rubric requirements \(50 Marks\), the project) Tj T* (delivers: \(1\) Automated ingestion with SHA-256 verification and a leak-free scikit-learn ColumnTransformer; \(2\) Detailed exploratory data analysis) Tj T* (with parametric and non-parametric hypothesis tests uncovering the Angina Paradox and ischemic markers; \(3\) Multi-model benchmarking under) Tj T* (Stratified 5-Fold Cross-Validation, selecting L2 Logistic Regression as champion \(ROC-AUC = 0.9632, Recall = 89.29%\); \(4\) Centralized) Tj T* (experiment tracking in MLflow; \(5\) Hermetic packaging into reusable pipeline and MLflow formats; \(6\) 18 automated Pytest tests in a 4-stage) Tj T* (GitHub Actions CI/CD pipeline; \(7\) Multi-stage non-root Docker containerization \(`mlopsuser`, UID 10001\); \(8\) Production Kubernetes deployment) Tj T* -0.056421 Tw (manifests and Helm chart with HPA autoscaling \(2\2268 pods\); and \(9\) Full-stack observability with structured JSON logging, Prometheus metrics, and) Tj T* 0 Tw (a live Grafana dashboard.) Tj T* ET
