BT 1 0 0 1 0 15 Tm /F1 8 Tf 11.5 TL (In standard statistical learning, models frequently optimize symmetric loss functions \(such as binary cross-entropy or classification accuracy\),) Tj T* (treating all misclassifications as equally undesirable. In clinical risk stratification, however, this assumption is profoundly dangerous:) Tj T* ET
