BT 1 0 0 1 0 38 Tm 11.5 TL /F1 8 Tf .176471 .215686 .282353 rg (Under US FDA SaMD guidelines, EU Medical Device Regulation \(MDR 2017/745\), and ISO 13485 standards, clinical computational models must) Tj T* (operate within strict governance boundaries: \(1\) ) Tj /F4 8 Tf (Physician-in-the-Loop:) Tj /F1 8 Tf ( The system acts strictly as an advisory Clinical Decision Support System) Tj T* (\(CDSS\); \(2\) ) Tj /F4 8 Tf (Auditability:) Tj /F1 8 Tf ( Every prediction must be deterministically reproducible from logged feature inputs; and \(3\) ) Tj /F4 8 Tf (Input Clamping:) Tj /F1 8 Tf  T* (Non-physiological inputs must be rejected at the API boundary.) Tj T* ET
