BT 1 0 0 1 0 141.5 Tm 11.5 TL /F1 8 Tf .176471 .215686 .282353 rg (\177 ) Tj /F2 8 Tf (Tier 1: Data Ingestion & Preprocessing Engine:) Tj /F1 8 Tf ( Automated ingestion from the UC Irvine repository with SHA-256 integrity validation) Tj T* (\(`download_data.py`\). Data cleaning \(`clean_data.py`\) validates schemas and preserves missing values as NaNs. The feature transformer) Tj T* (\(`build_features.py`\) constructs a scikit-learn `ColumnTransformer` that is fitted purely on cross-validation training folds, eliminating data leakage.) Tj  T* (\177 ) Tj /F2 8 Tf (Tier 2: Model Development & Experiment Governance:) Tj /F1 8 Tf ( Stratified 5-Fold Grid Search CV benchmarking candidate algorithms \(`train.py`,) Tj T* (`evaluate.py`\). Centralized experiment tracking via MLflow \(`mlruns/`\) logs hyperparameter spaces, CV fold metrics, ROC curves, confusion) Tj T* (matrices, and serialized pipelines.) Tj  T* (\177 ) Tj /F2 8 Tf (Tier 3: Packaging, Quality Assurance & CI/CD Pipeline:) Tj /F1 8 Tf ( Serialization of champion pipelines \(`models/model_pipeline.joblib` and) Tj T* (`models/mlflow_model/`\). An 18-test automated Pytest suite enforces 100% code correctness across data, features, model inference, and API) Tj T* (contracts. The GitHub Actions pipeline automates linting, testing, training verification, and Docker image builds on every push.) Tj  T* (\177 ) Tj /F2 8 Tf (Tier 4: Model Serving, Orchestration & Telemetry Observability:) Tj /F1 8 Tf ( FastAPI asynchronous microservice with Pydantic v2 boundary validation.) Tj T* (Packaged into a hardened non-root Docker container \(`mlopsuser`, UID 10001\) and orchestrated via Kubernetes manifests and Helm chart with) Tj T* (HPA autoscaling \(2\2268 pods\). Real-time telemetry is captured via structured JSON logging, Prometheus metrics scraping \(`/metrics`\), and a live) Tj T* (Grafana dashboard.) Tj T* ET
