BT 1 0 0 1 0 141.5 Tm 11.5 TL /F1 8 Tf .176471 .215686 .282353 rg (When an inference request arrives at the API gateway, it traverses a deterministic 6-stage lifecycle:) Tj  T* (1. ) Tj /F2 8 Tf (Ingress & Load Balancing:) Tj /F1 8 Tf ( The Kubernetes Ingress controller terminates TLS and balances traffic across active pod endpoints.) Tj  T* (2. ) Tj /F2 8 Tf (ASGI Middleware Interception:) Tj /F1 8 Tf ( Custom middleware in `src/api/middleware.py` generates a unique UUID request trace ID, starts a) Tj T* (high-resolution timer, and increments the Prometheus incoming request counter.) Tj  T* (3. ) Tj /F2 8 Tf (Pydantic Boundary Validation:) Tj /F1 8 Tf ( Payload JSON is deserialized into the `HeartDiseaseInput` model. If any biomarker falls outside physiological) Tj T* (bounds \(e.g., blood pressure > 300 mm Hg\), execution halts immediately with HTTP 422.) Tj  T* (4. ) Tj /F2 8 Tf (Pipeline Transformation & Scoring:) Tj /F1 8 Tf ( The validated dictionary is converted into a single-row Pandas DataFrame and passed to) Tj T* (`model_pipeline.predict_proba\(\)`. Missing values are imputed using stored training medians/modes, features are scaled, and the champion) Tj T* (classifier evaluates posterior probability.) Tj  T* (5. ) Tj /F2 8 Tf (Risk Categorization & Latency Measurement:) Tj /F1 8 Tf ( The raw probability is mapped to the 4-tier clinical risk scale \(LOW, MODERATE, HIGH,) Tj T* (CRITICAL\). The timer records duration.) Tj  T* (6. ) Tj /F2 8 Tf (Telemetry Emission & Response:) Tj /F1 8 Tf ( Prometheus histograms record execution duration, structured JSON logs emit the transaction, and the client) Tj T* (receives a structured HTTP 200 response.) Tj T* ET
