BT 1 0 0 1 0 49.5 Tm 11.5 TL /F1 8 Tf .176471 .215686 .282353 rg (In the raw dataset, missing values are denoted by the string token `?`. Across 303 patient records and 14 features \(4,242 total data cells\), exactly 6) Tj T* (cells contained `?`:) Tj  T* (\177 `ca` \(major vessels colored by fluoroscopy\): 4 missing entries \(1.32% of column\).) Tj  T* (\177 `thal` \(thallium nuclear scintigraphy\): 2 missing entries \(0.66% of column\).) Tj  T* (\177 All other 12 attributes are 100% complete with zero missingness.) Tj T* ET
