BT 1 0 0 1 0 72.5 Tm 11.5 TL /F1 8 Tf .176471 .215686 .282353 rg (A naive data cleaning script would simply drop any row containing a missing value \(`df.dropna\(\)`\), discarding 6 patient records. In clinical machine) Tj T* (learning, this practice introduces severe hazards:) Tj  T* -0.0324 Tw (1. ) Tj /F2 8 Tf (Referral Bias Amplification:) Tj /F1 8 Tf ( Patients who do not receive fluoroscopy or nuclear scintigraphy often differ systematically from those who do \(e.g.,) Tj T* 0 Tw (severe renal impairment precluding contrast dyes, acute unstable symptoms requiring immediate catheterization, or insurance exclusions\).) Tj T* (Dropping these patients introduces survival and referral biases, altering feature distributions.) Tj  T* (2. ) Tj /F2 8 Tf (Real-World Inference Brittleness:) Tj /F1 8 Tf ( In production hospital workflows, incoming patients frequently have incomplete lab results. If a model was) Tj T* (trained only on pristine complete cases, it cannot handle real-world partial observations gracefully.) Tj T* ET
Q
