BT 1 0 0 1 0 38 Tm 11.5 TL /F2 8 Tf .176471 .215686 .282353 rg (Zero-Leakage Imputation Protocol:) Tj /F1 8 Tf ( We explicitly replace `?` with `numpy.nan` in `data/processed/heart_cleaned.csv` without dropping records.) Tj T* (Imputation is encapsulated strictly within the scikit-learn `Pipeline` during model training. Missing numerical values \(`ca`\) are imputed using the) Tj T* (training fold's median; missing categorical values \(`thal`\) are imputed using the training fold's mode. **Test set records are never consulted during) Tj T* (imputation.**) Tj T* ET
