BT 1 0 0 1 0 38 Tm 11.5 TL /F2 8 Tf .176471 .215686 .282353 rg (2. Biological Sex Disparities \(`sex`\):) Tj /F1 8 Tf  T* (Men in our cohort had more than double the coronary disease prevalence of women \() Tj /F2 8 Tf (55.3% in men vs. 25.8% in women) Tj /F1 8 Tf (, $\\chi^2 = 23.46, p <) Tj T* (10^{-6}$\). This reflects both pre-menopausal estrogenic vascular protection in women and historical under-referral of female patients for diagnostic) Tj T* (catheterization.) Tj T* ET
