BT 1 0 0 1 0 61 Tm 11.5 TL /F1 8 Tf .176471 .215686 .282353 rg (To guarantee clinical service level agreements \(SLAs\), the Prometheus scraper is configured with alerting rules designed around the Google SRE) Tj T* (RED \(Rate, Errors, Duration\) framework:) Tj  T* (\177 ) Tj /F2 8 Tf (Inference Latency Degradation:) Tj /F1 8 Tf ( Fires a warning alert if P95 inference latency exceeds 50 ms over a 5-minute window, and critical if > 100 ms.) Tj  T* (\177 ) Tj /F2 8 Tf (HTTP 5xx Error Rate:) Tj /F1 8 Tf ( Fires immediately if error responses exceed 1% of total request volume.) Tj  T* (\177 ) Tj /F2 8 Tf (Concept Drift / Prediction Skew:) Tj /F1 8 Tf ( Tracks ratio of positive to negative diagnoses. If positive rate deviates by > 2.5 standard deviations from) Tj T* (baseline prevalence \(45.8%\), alerts on potential demographic drift.) Tj T* ET
