.176471 .215686 .282353 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 15 Tm /F1 8 Tf 11.5 TL (Looking back at the implementation of this platform, three practical architectural choices saved significant development time and prevented) Tj T* (production bugs:) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 46 598 cm
q
BT 1 0 0 1 0 84 Tm 11.5 TL /F1 8 Tf .176471 .215686 .282353 rg (1. ) Tj /F2 8 Tf (Binding Preprocessing Inside the Estimator Pipeline:) Tj /F1 8 Tf ( Packaging the `ColumnTransformer` and classifier into a single serialized `Pipeline`) Tj T* (\(`models/model_pipeline.joblib`\) eliminated training-serving skew. The FastAPI serving layer passes raw dictionaries to `pipeline.predict_proba\(\)`,) Tj T* (which applies the exact transformations learned during training.) Tj  T* (2. ) Tj /F2 8 Tf (Prioritizing Clinical Recall Over Headline Accuracy:) Tj /F1 8 Tf ( If I had chased raw accuracy alone, I might have selected a complex model that scored) Tj T* (89% accuracy but quietly missed 6 diseased patients \(a 21.4% false negative rate\). Optimizing for Recall and ROC-AUC kept missed cases down) Tj T* (to just 3 patients out of 28 \(10.71% false negative rate\).) Tj  T* (3. ) Tj /F2 8 Tf (Structured JSON Logging from Day One:) Tj /F1 8 Tf ( Writing custom ASGI middleware to emit JSON logs made debugging straightforward. In log) Tj T* (collectors, querying by `status_code == 422` or `risk_level == 'CRITICAL'` works immediately without brittle regular expressions.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 46 578 cm
q
BT 1 0 0 1 0 3.5 Tm 13 TL /F2 9.5 Tf .101961 .211765 .364706 rg (14.1 Practical Challenges Encountered & Overcome) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 46 480 cm
q
BT 1 0 0 1 0 84 Tm 11.5 TL /F1 8 Tf .176471 .215686 .282353 rg (\177 ) Tj /F2 8 Tf (The Missing Data Dilemma \(`?` Tokens\):) Tj /F1 8 Tf ( The raw Cleveland dataset stores missing values as `?` in `ca` and `thal`. The instinctive move is to) Tj T* -0.090909 Tw (call `df.dropna\(\)`. But throwing away 6 rows out of 303 introduces severe clinical referral bias because patients who skip fluoroscopy often have dye) Tj T* 0 Tw -0.010947 Tw (allergies or acute distress. Deferring imputation to median/mode transformers inside the training pipeline solved this cleanly with zero data leakage.) Tj  T* 0 Tw (\177 ) Tj /F2 8 Tf (Non-Root Container Security in Healthcare IT:) Tj /F1 8 Tf ( Running Docker containers as root is an immediate red flag in hospital infrastructure. I explicitly) Tj T* (configured `Dockerfile` to create an unprivileged user `mlopsuser` \(UID 10001\) with a read-only root filesystem, restricting write access to `/tmp`.) Tj  T* (\177 ) Tj /F2 8 Tf (Boundary Clamping via Pydantic:) Tj /F1 8 Tf ( Testing highlighted that malformed inputs \(like negative blood pressure or extreme cholesterol values from) Tj T* (sensor glitches\) would produce nonsensical predictions if passed to the model. Clamping boundaries in Pydantic v2 schemas halted these bad) Tj T* (payloads at the gateway layer with clear HTTP 422 error messages.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 46 460 cm
q
