BT 1 0 0 1 0 61 Tm 11.5 TL /F1 8 Tf .176471 .215686 .282353 rg (\177 ) Tj /F2 8 Tf (Explainability Services \(SHAP & LIME\):) Tj /F1 8 Tf ( Integrating TreeSHAP and KernelSHAP into `/predict` responses to return patient-specific waterfall) Tj T* (plots showing exactly which biomarkers drove the risk score.) Tj  T* (\177 ) Tj /F2 8 Tf (Continuous Drift Monitoring \(Evidently AI\):) Tj /F1 8 Tf ( Implementing automated daily Kolmogorov-Smirnov drift tests comparing live inference feature) Tj T* (distributions against baseline training distributions.) Tj  T* (\177 ) Tj /F2 8 Tf (A/B Canary Deployments via Istio Service Mesh:) Tj /F1 8 Tf ( Deploying new candidate model iterations to 10% of live traffic with automatic rollback if) Tj T* (latency or error rates spike.) Tj T* ET
